"PRIVACY · DATA TRANSPARENCY":"PRIVACY · DATA TRANSPARENCY","Privacy Notice":"Privacy Notice","Explains what information may be processed by TAVIRO's offline game, optional account, online score and cosmetic inventory features.":"Explains what information may be processed by TAVIRO's offline game, optional account, online score and cosmetic inventory features.","Last updated: 16 November 2026 · Version 1.0":"Last updated: 16 November 2026 · Version 1.0",
"1. Data controller and scope":"1. Data controller and scope","TAVIRO is an independent game project. This page describes the current web version's technical behavior; it is not legal advice and does not replace the privacy notices of platform providers.":"TAVIRO is an independent game project. This page describes the current web version's technical behavior; it is not legal advice and does not replace the privacy notices of platform providers.",
"2. Information that may be processed":"2. Information that may be processed","Account: email address and session information managed by Supabase Auth. Pilot profile: username, represented country and optional profile image, which may be public in shared rankings. Game progress: level, XP, achievements, run summaries, scores and cosmetic inventory. Online features: Ranked results and Co-op room, participant and match-result details. Device data: language, audio and accessibility preferences, offline save and local cosmetic preferences.":"Account: email address and session information managed by Supabase Auth. Pilot profile: username, represented country and optional profile image, which may be public in shared rankings. Game progress: level, XP, achievements, run summaries, scores and cosmetic inventory. Online features: Ranked results and Co-op room, participant and match-result details. Device data: language, audio and accessibility preferences, offline save and local cosmetic preferences.",
"3. Service providers":"3. Service providers","GitHub Pages hosts the game's web files. Supabase processes optional account authentication, profiles, cloud saves, scores and online game data. FlagCDN serves some country flag images. These providers' own privacy and security terms also apply. The game can be played offline; creating an account is optional.":"GitHub Pages hosts the game's web files. Supabase processes optional account authentication, profiles, cloud saves, scores and online game data. FlagCDN serves some country flag images. These providers' own privacy and security terms also apply. The game can be played offline; creating an account is optional.",
"4. Purpose and sharing":"4. Purpose and sharing","Information is used to authenticate accounts, sync progress between devices, display rankings, operate Ranked/Co-op matches and verify reward ownership. TAVIRO does not sell personal data and this version does not include a third-party advertising network or advertising SDK. Public profile fields and leaderboards may be visible to other players.":"Information is used to authenticate accounts, sync progress between devices, display rankings, operate Ranked/Co-op matches and verify reward ownership. TAVIRO does not sell personal data and this version does not include a third-party advertising network or advertising SDK. Public profile fields and leaderboards may be visible to other players.",
"5. Retention and security":"5. Retention and security","Local saves are stored in browser storage; account-synced data is stored on Supabase infrastructure. Appropriate access controls and database policies are used, but no internet-connected system can be guaranteed absolutely secure. Do not share your sign-in details.":"Local saves are stored in browser storage; account-synced data is stored on Supabase infrastructure. Appropriate access controls and database policies are used, but no internet-connected system can be guaranteed absolutely secure. Do not share your sign-in details.",
"6. Deletion and privacy requests":"6. Deletion and privacy requests","The current game interface does not yet provide self-service account deletion. For data access or deletion requests, contact the project owner through the GitHub profile. Never post email addresses, passwords, access tokens or other sensitive information in public GitHub issues.":"The current game interface does not yet provide self-service account deletion. For data access or deletion requests, contact the project owner through the GitHub profile. Never post email addresses, passwords, access tokens or other sensitive information in public GitHub issues.",
"7. Children's and young people's privacy":"7. Children's and young people's privacy","Before using accounts and online features, check the age and parental-consent rules where you live. Before store publication, this notice, the target age group and data flows should be reviewed by a responsible adult.":"Before using accounts and online features, check the age and parental-consent rules where you live. Before store publication, this notice, the target age group and data flows should be reviewed by a responsible adult.",
"8. Required before store publication":"8. Required before store publication","This is an initial notice based on the current web version. Before Google Play or App Store publication, official support/privacy contact details, data-retention periods, the account-deletion method and platform-specific disclosures must be completed and legally reviewed.":"This is an initial notice based on the current web version. Before Google Play or App Store publication, official support/privacy contact details, data-retention periods, the account-deletion method and platform-specific disclosures must be completed and legally reviewed.",
"PLAYER SUPPORT CENTER":"PLAYER SUPPORT CENTER","How can we help?":"How can we help?","Use the channels below for bug reports, accessibility feedback and technical issues with the game.":"Use the channels below for bug reports, accessibility feedback and technical issues with the game.","TAVIRO · Version 1.0":"TAVIRO · Version 1.0",
"Bug reports":"Bug reports","Report technical issues through GitHub Issues. If possible, include your device type, browser/operating-system version and steps to reproduce the issue.":"Report technical issues through GitHub Issues. If possible, include your device type, browser/operating-system version and steps to reproduce the issue.","Open a TAVIRO bug report ↗":"Open a TAVIRO bug report ↗",
"Source code and releases":"Source code and releases","Development records, release history and known issues are maintained in the public repository.":"Development records, release history and known issues are maintained in the public repository.","Open the GitHub repository ↗":"Open the GitHub repository ↗",
"Privacy and account":"Privacy and account","Read the Privacy Notice for information about processed data and accounts. Do not include email addresses, passwords, access tokens or personal documents in public issues.":"Read the Privacy Notice for information about processed data and accounts. Do not include email addresses, passwords, access tokens or personal documents in public issues.","Read the Privacy Notice":"Read the Privacy Notice","View the project owner's GitHub profile":"View the project owner's GitHub profile",
"Known platform limitations":"Known platform limitations","Offline single-player mode can be used without an account. Cloud saves and Co-op require an internet connection and a signed-in account. Co-op beta features depend on connection and server status. The web version and native Android/iOS packages are not at the same verification stage.":"Offline single-player mode can be used without an account. Cloud saves and Co-op require an internet connection and a signed-in account. Co-op beta features depend on connection and server status. The web version and native Android/iOS packages are not at the same verification stage."
